WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.830
- "Monica" is pretty personal for you,

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.270
this film is pretty personal, right?

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.103
- Oh, yeah.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.757
I mean, every trans
story is personal for me.

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:09.300
"Monica," I mean, there's
so many Monicas out there.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.300
I feel like our journey with our families,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.770
and just where we fall in the world,

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.810
and how the world makes space for us,

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.490
or doesn't make space for us,

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.457
is always gonna be a fight
that we're gonna have to fight,

00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:25.668
at least in my lifetime, probably.

00:00:25.668 --> 00:00:29.700
But, this movie, it, you
know, it's for the girls,

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.440
it's for the dolls, it's
for the femme queens.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.493
It's for the trans women that.

00:00:32.493 --> 00:00:35.493
(audience applauds)

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.060
I have been waiting for so long

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.320
for their stories to be told.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.370
It centers on her.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.800
It's not centered on someone else.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.830
It's through her lens,
which is very different.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.710
Usually, you know, if
there's a trans person

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:53.280
involved in a movie,
they're not the protagonist,

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.690
they're not the centerpiece.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.670
So, that's why this film is so special.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.550
- But, that's why I said
yes, faster to this film

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:03.360
than any film I've ever
done in my very long career.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.193
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:04.193 --> 00:01:07.440
- Because, it was, kind of
still very emotional for me.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.656
It was not lost on me, Kelly,

00:01:09.656 --> 00:01:14.100
that it would give an
extraordinary transgender actress

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:14.933
the lead.

00:01:14.933 --> 00:01:17.550
I said, I'll be your
backup singer any day.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.770
I knew how important this film was.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:20.603
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:20.603 --> 00:01:24.810
- What "Monica" does, is
deeply humanizes a trans woman

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.160
at the center of a story.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:26.993
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:26.993 --> 00:01:28.707
- We are human beings deserving of love,

00:01:28.707 --> 00:01:31.560
deserving of rights and respect,

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.140
and it's really about
a rehumanizing process

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.750
that has to happen in
relationship to trans people.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.513
And, great storytelling is
a beautiful way to do that.

